.TH VALIDATE-INTAKE-GOVERNANCE-CONFIG 1 "2026-09-05" "intake-authoring-governance 0.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
validate-intake-governance-config \- AOC-Profilvertrag pruefen
.br
validate the AOC profile contract
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B validate-intake-governance-config.sh
.BI --config " FILE"
.RI [ --repo " PATH" ]
.RI [ --json ]
.PP
.B validate-intake-governance-config.ps1
.BI -Config " FILE"
.RI [ -Repo " PATH" ]
.RI [ -Json ]
.SH BESCHREIBUNG / DESCRIPTION
Prueft Schema 2.0, den repository-relativen Profilpfad, passende Profil-ID,
Dokumentationssprache de-DE, exakte erlaubte Wurzeln, vier portable Rollen,
sechs Collections, Benennung, Inventar, Archive und fehlende implizite
Autoritaet. Ein fehlendes oder widerspruechliches Profil, eine falsche Root,
ID oder Locale und Hashdrift sperren fail-closed.
.PP
Validates schema 2.0, the repository-relative profile path, matching profile
ID, de-DE documentation language, exact allowed roots, four portable roles,
six collections, naming, inventory, archives, and absence of implicit
authority. A missing or contradictory profile, wrong root, ID or locale, and
hash drift fail closed.
.PP
Die Pruefung ist read-only und erteilt keine Ausfuehrungs- oder
Delivery-Autoritaet. / Validation is read-only and grants no execution or
delivery authority.
.SH OPTIONEN / OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --config " " FILE , " " -Config " " FILE
Governance-Konfiguration. / Governance configuration.
.TP
.BR --journal " " FILE , " " -Journal " " FILE
Separates Migrationsjournal. / Separate migration journal.
.TP
.BR --repo " " PATH , " " -Repo " " PATH
Repository-Wurzel. / Repository root.
.TP
.BR --json , " " -Json
Maschinenlesbares JSON. / Machine-readable JSON.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Aligned oder gueltiges Journal. / Aligned or valid journal.
.TP
.B 1
MigrationRequired oder NeedsClarification.
.TP
.B 2
Blocked oder ungueltige Eingabe. / Blocked or invalid input.
.SH BEISPIELE / EXAMPLES
.nf
bash .specify/presets/intake-authoring-governance/scripts/validate-intake-governance-config.sh \
  --config requirements/intake-governance.json --repo . --json

pwsh -NoProfile -File .specify/presets/intake-authoring-governance/scripts/validate-intake-governance-config.ps1 \
  -Config requirements/intake-governance.json -Repo . -Json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR validate-intake-authoring-receipt (1),
.BR validate-authoring-contract (1)
